{
  "slug": "shipnote",
  "name": "Shipnote",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Turn your daily dev activity into build-in-public posts. Scans git repos, generates human-sounding posts, schedules future posts, and auto-publishes to Threads.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `generate-post` (Generate a build-in-public post from recent git activity), `shipnote` (Generate a build-in-public post from your recent git activity), `shipnote-log` (View your past Shipnote posts), `shipnote-schedule` (Schedule, list, and manage draft posts for future publishing), `shipnote-setup` (Configure Shipnote — set your tone, platform, repos path, and preferences)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install shipnote@claude-community` from `PetarStoev02/shipnote`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
